### Dragon Ball Characters API - APIBox Testing
### Endpoint Base
@baseUrl = https://apibox.vercel.app/2aSCD2Sbz4kg4AcacfeJLMmalhKR3Xgs/api/personajes

### 1. Listar todos los personajes (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Crear un nuevo personaje (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Goku",
  "image": "https://dragonball-api.com/characters/goku_normal.webp",
  "race": "Saiyan"
}

### 3. Crear Vegeta (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Vegeta",
  "image": "https://dragonball-api.com/characters/vegeta_normal.webp",
  "race": "Saiyan"
}

### 4. Crear Piccolo (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Piccolo",
  "image": "https://dragonball-api.com/characters/picolo_normal.webp",
  "race": "Namekian"
}

### 5. Actualizar un personaje (PUT)
### Reemplazar {{id}} con el ID obtenido en el GET
@id = 1
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Son Goku Super Saiyan",
  "image": "https://dragonball-api.com/characters/goku_normal.webp",
  "race": "Saiyan"
}

### 6. Eliminar un personaje (DELETE)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json
